{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Take the head count of the sons of Gershon, them as well.</b> Because in the census above, from a month old and upward, the sons of Gershon were counted first, since he was the eldest of the sons of Levi, as it is said: ״ובני לוי גרשון וקהת ומררי״; but in this census, from thirty years old and upward, the sons of Kehat were counted first, because the primary labor rested upon them — the Ark and the altars. Therefore regarding the sons of Gershon it mentions גם הם — meaning: I did not leave them out entirely from being counted, but 'them as well' I count."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:56.809352046Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}